{"data": [{"author_id": "83466368", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:52:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115849208494178428"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 149, "id": "304909941", "start": 141, "username": "Lagarde"}], "urls": [{"description": "Webcasts of ECB press conferences", "display_url": "link.europa.eu/KByWRW", "end": 186, "expanded_url": "https://link.europa.eu/KByWRW", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115566473896992768/rcMpWujs?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115566473896992768/rcMpWujs?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 163, "status": 200, "title": "Webcasts: ECB monetary policy decisions", "unwound_url": "https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/press_conference/html/index.en.html", "url": "https://t.co/GaO1SUSKBo"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/oZSfYnRHj5", "end": 210, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2115849208494178428/video/1", "media_key": "13_2115849158632353792", "start": 187, "url": "https://t.co/oZSfYnRHj5"}]}, "id": "2115849208494178428", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 10984, "like_count": 95, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 17}, "text": "The Governing Council decided to keep interest rates unchanged.\n\nWe are committed to ensuring that inflation stabilises at 2% says President @Lagarde.\n\nWatch here https://t.co/GaO1SUSKBo https://t.co/oZSfYnRHj5", "url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2115849208494178428"}, {"author_id": "279036722", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:43:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115847000344416386"], "id": "2115847000344416386", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 28, "impression_count": 28168, "like_count": 194, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 23}, "text": "1. AI should play a large role before we see anything from anyone so it comes out right in the first place.\n\n2. AI should play a big role in retrospective replications.\n\n3. Piketty-Saez-Zucman work has many flaws that all go one direction.\n\nSpreading slop hurts all three causes.", "url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2115847000344416386"}, {"author_id": "279036722", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:39:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115846030080258145"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/carney/status/…", "end": 85, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/carney/status/2115825327444259300", "start": 62, "url": "https://t.co/xCcQB3rBRP"}]}, "id": "2115846030080258145", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 13202, "like_count": 70, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115825327444259300", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Did no one check any of this before launching the Revolution? https://t.co/xCcQB3rBRP", "url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2115846030080258145"}, {"author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:32:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115843942532968800", "2115844131985494092"], "id": "2115844131985494092", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 120, "impression_count": 38502, "like_count": 650, "quote_count": 26, "reply_count": 218, "retweet_count": 36}, "text": "I think “sell picks and shovels” is the wrong lesson for AI startups.\n\nThe Gold Rush analogy is weaker than the Industrial Revolution. Gold is a single pile that runs out. Machines keep making everything cheaper. Far more people got rich using the new machines than building them.", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2115844131985494092"}, {"author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:31:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115843942532968800", "2115844131985494092"], "id": "2115843942532968800", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4108, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I think“sell picks and shovels” is the wrong lesson for AI startups.\n\nThe Gold Rush analogy is weaker than the Industrial Revolution. Gold is a single pile that runs out. Machines keep making everything cheaper. Far more people got rich using the new machines than building them.", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2115843942532968800"}, {"author_id": "83466368", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:04:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115837286491554003"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 209, "id": "304909941", "start": 201, "username": "Lagarde"}], "urls": [{"description": "Listen to President Lagarde presents the latest monetary policy decisions – 29 October 2026 from Euro Matters – the European Central Bank Podcast wherever you get your podcasts!", "display_url": "pod.link/ecbpodcast/epi…", "end": 279, "expanded_url": "https://pod.link/ecbpodcast/episode/dGFnOnNvdW5kY2xvdWQsMjAxMDp0cmFja3MvMjQyODM0MTA1Nw", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115837300555067392/45zIRiO8?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115837300555067392/45zIRiO8?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 256, "status": 200, "title": "President Lagarde presents the latest monetary policy decisions – 29 October 2026", "unwound_url": "https://pod.link/ecbpodcast/episode/dGFnOnNvdW5kY2xvdWQsMjAxMDp0cmFja3MvMjQyODM0MTA1Nw", "url": "https://t.co/0PSRYNfog2"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/Zox4sqjaUl", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2115837286491554003/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115837278807355392", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/Zox4sqjaUl"}]}, "id": "2115837286491554003", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 12479, "like_count": 40, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "We’ve just taken our latest monetary policy decisions, determined to ensure that inflation stabilises at our two percent target in the medium term.\n\nTune in to Euro Matters to hear President Christine @Lagarde present the decisions in our press conference https://t.co/0PSRYNfog2 https://t.co/Zox4sqjaUl", "url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2115837286491554003"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:03:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115837025857442250"], "id": "2115837025857442250", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 6604, "like_count": 66, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Claude Duet being a separate app is not ideal", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2115837025857442250"}, {"author_id": "83466368", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:52:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115834253326086305"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The European Central Bank (ECB) is the central bank of the European Union countries which have adopted the euro. Our main task is to maintain price stability in the euro area and so preserve the purchasing power of the single currency.", "display_url": "link.europa.eu/fDQKJn", "end": 280, "expanded_url": "https://link.europa.eu/fDQKJn", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115834261635051520/FwjRtaaj?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115834261635051520/FwjRtaaj?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 257, "status": 200, "title": "Next-day securities settlement, tokenisation and the transformation of Europe’s financial infrastructure", "unwound_url": "https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/key/date/2026/html/ecb.sp261029~e9b57c3495.en.html", "url": "https://t.co/7bGSoSfVsd"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/JamtLaKrAD", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2115834253326086305/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115832160598798337", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/JamtLaKrAD"}]}, "id": "2115834253326086305", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 7470, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Next-day securities settlement is a key step towards making financial markets more competitive, says Executive Board member Piero Cipollone.\nIt is part of a broader push to make Europe’s financial and payment system safer, more efficient and more resilient https://t.co/7bGSoSfVsd https://t.co/JamtLaKrAD", "url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2115834253326086305"}, {"author_id": "612896910", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:48:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115833071811572061"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 95, "start": 87, "tag": "BLSdata"}], "urls": [{"description": "The .gov means it's official. Federal government websites often end in .gov or .mil. Before sharing sensitive information, make sure you're on a federal government site. The site is secure. The https:// ensures that you are connecting to the official website and that any information you provide is encrypted and transmitted securely. Teams from Milwaukee and Tampa slugged it out this week in baseball’s championship series. It was Milwaukee’s first trip to the series since 1982, while Tampa’s last visit", "display_url": "bls.gov/opub/ted/2026/…", "end": 86, "expanded_url": "https://www.bls.gov/opub/ted/2026/baseballs-championship-series-ran-through-milwaukee-and-tampa.htm", "images": [{"height": 126, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115833079730425856/vDxRgTLh?format=png&name=orig", "width": 228}, {"height": 126, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115833079730425856/vDxRgTLh?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 126}], "start": 63, "status": 200, "title": "Baseball's championship series ran through Milwaukee and Tampa : The Economics Daily : U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics", "unwound_url": "https://www.bls.gov/opub/ted/2026/baseballs-championship-series-ran-through-milwaukee-and-tampa.htm", "url": "https://t.co/h2rKXmymle"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/bSwo60c2KL", "end": 119, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BLS_gov/status/2115833071811572061/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115832663659401216", "start": 96, "url": "https://t.co/bSwo60c2KL"}]}, "id": "2115833071811572061", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2475, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Baseball's championship series ran through Milwaukee and Tampa https://t.co/h2rKXmymle #BLSdata https://t.co/bSwo60c2KL", "url": "https://x.com/BLS_gov/status/2115833071811572061"}, {"author_id": "83466368", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:58:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115820635666501742"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "We take decisions on monetary policy every six weeks determining what should be done to keep inflation under control. Our visual statement explains this in short and easy-to-understand language.", "display_url": "ecb.europa.eu/press/press_co…", "end": 265, "expanded_url": "https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/press_conference/visual-mps/2026/html/mopo_statement_explained_october.en.html", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115820644629639168/cLX2RJGC?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115820644629639168/cLX2RJGC?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 242, "status": 200, "title": "Our monetary policy statement at a glance - October 2026", "unwound_url": "https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/press_conference/visual-mps/2026/html/mopo_statement_explained_october.en.html", "url": "https://t.co/stTMdnXmke"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/rsPJX7wjRl", "end": 289, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2115820635666501742/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115815188255404032", "start": 266, "url": "https://t.co/rsPJX7wjRl"}]}, "id": "2115820635666501742", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 12846, "like_count": 30, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "Today we kept our key interest rates at their current levels.\n\nWe are well positioned to deal with the very uncertain economic situation.\n\nInflation has gone up again, but the economy keeps growing despite headwinds and many people have jobs https://t.co/stTMdnXmke https://t.co/rsPJX7wjRl", "url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2115820635666501742"}, {"author_id": "279036722", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:50:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115818666918862861"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jasoncrawford/…", "end": 61, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jasoncrawford/status/2115530552464044181", "start": 38, "url": "https://t.co/KBcQcGuOJD"}]}, "id": "2115818666918862861", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 44, "impression_count": 21420, "like_count": 73, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 6}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115530552464044181", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Best roundup on this issue I've seen: https://t.co/KBcQcGuOJD", "url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2115818666918862861"}, {"author_id": "321536046", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:40:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115816139225739316"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "bea.gov/news/schedule/…", "end": 124, "expanded_url": "https://www.bea.gov/news/schedule/next-year", "start": 101, "status": 200, "title": "Release Schedule | U.S. Bureau of Economic Analysis (BEA)", "unwound_url": "https://www.bea.gov/news/schedule/next-year", "url": "https://t.co/dg4RLWg6vZ"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/YNzkIQPZCX", "end": 148, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BEA_News/status/2115816139225739316/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115816128911986688", "start": 125, "url": "https://t.co/YNzkIQPZCX"}]}, "id": "2115816139225739316", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 843, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Mark your calendars! The 2027 economic release schedule is now available. Check out what’s coming at https://t.co/dg4RLWg6vZ https://t.co/YNzkIQPZCX", "url": "https://x.com/BEA_News/status/2115816139225739316"}, {"author_id": "279036722", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:35:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115814704241344965"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/D18TB8JbhZ", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2115814704241344965/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115811606688825344", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/D18TB8JbhZ"}]}, "id": "2115814704241344965", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 13322, "like_count": 53, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "BEA has quarterly GDP data back to 1947. Of the 318 quarters it tracks this was the third most negative contribution from net exports (and the second largest was 2025-Q1).\n\nThat is, much of the consumption, investment, etc was imported--so take 3.3pp of GDP off what those added. https://t.co/D18TB8JbhZ", "url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2115814704241344965"}, {"author_id": "612896910", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:02:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115806508563001563"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 113, "start": 105, "tag": "BLSdata"}], "urls": [{"description": "The .gov means it's official. Federal government websites often end in .gov or .mil. Before sharing sensitive in formation, make sure you're on a federal government site. The site is secure. The https:// ensures that you are connecting to the official website and that any information you provide is encrypted and transmitted securely. For release 10:00 a.m. (ET) Thursday, October 29, 2026 USDL-26-1619 Technical information: (202) 691-6900 * CEXInfo@bls.gov * www.bls.gov/cex Media contact: (202) 691-5902 *", "display_url": "bls.gov/news.release/c…", "end": 104, "expanded_url": "https://www.bls.gov/news.release/cesan.nr0.htm", "images": [{"height": 126, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115806170522800128/j3r-kZXb?format=png&name=orig", "width": 228}, {"height": 126, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115806170522800128/j3r-kZXb?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 126}], "start": 81, "status": 200, "title":